OL,3,GNEWSADad's brain cancer plea after
OL,4,Amigraines dismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being told a few times his
OL,7,Fmigraines were caused by dehydration,
OL,8,FKash Raju knew something was not right.
OL,10,FThe 33-year-old from Derby said the
OL,11,Fsudden death of a friend from a blood
OL,12,Fclot prompted him to go to A&E, where a
OL,13,FCT scan revealed he had brain cancer.
OL,15,FGiven less than 12 months to live, Raju
OL,16,Fis now raising #200,000 for treatment
OL,17,Fabroad and urges others to "advocate
OL,18,Fyourself" and get persistent symptoms
OL,19,Fchecked.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
